license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/marcelogdomingues/ulht-dcs-public"
url: "https://github.com/marcelogdomingues/ulht-dcs-public"
abstract: >-
  An event-driven microservices platform for issuing and verifying W3C
  Verifiable Credentials (OID4VCI/OID4VP via walt.id), built on Java 25 and
  Spring Boot 4 with Apache Kafka in KRaft mode, and accompanied by Flutter
  applications for students, verifiers and issuers. The system derives from an
  MSc thesis defended at Universidade Lusofona.
